  "plain": "An online researcher who goes by UAPGerb, on Jesse Michels's podcast in 2026, relays what Edgar Fouche, a man who said he worked on secret aircraft, claimed. Fouche said the program behind the TR3B, a secret triangle-shaped craft, was led by three spy agencies: the National Reconnaissance Office, which runs spy satellites, the CIA, and the National Security Agency, which handles electronic eavesdropping. If true, it would mean intelligence agencies, not the military, ran the project."
